Derived content
---------------
The files under:

    skills/canvas-lms-api/reference/

are generated from the Canvas LMS REST API documentation (the Swagger/JSON
API definitions and the accompanying prose guides) that Canvas produces from
the instructure/canvas-lms source tree. The generator script
(scripts/build_reference.py) extracts and reorganizes that documentation into
Markdown for progressive-disclosure consumption; the substantive content —
endpoint descriptions, parameters, object models, conceptual guides, and
permission descriptions — originates with Canvas LMS and remains the
copyright of Instructure, Inc.

The raw upstream snapshot used as the build input lives under `doc/` and is
intentionally excluded from version control (see .gitignore); only the
generated `reference/` is committed and distributed.

